    "body": "Unfortunately, it does not. This is the mercurial python code that locates the `.hg` directory.\r\n\r\n```\r\ndef findrepo(p):\r\n    while not os.path.isdir(os.path.join(p, b\".hg\")):\r\n        oldp, p = p, os.path.dirname(p)\r\n        if p == oldp:\r\n            return None\r\n    return p\r\n```",
